What is the result of explicit narrowing type casting in the following code snippet?

```java
float x = 6.82f;
int a = (int) x;
System.out.println(a);
```

What will be printed to the console given the modulus operator expression below?

```java
int x = 11, y = 3;
System.out.println(x % y);
```

Evaluate the following code utilizing the Math class. What is the output?

```java
double x = 9.0;
System.out.println(Math.sqrt(x) + Math.abs(-5));
```
